    "title": "Academic Speaking B1 course",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "ELE_net is currently offering the Academic Speaking course at two levels (B1 and B2 according to the CEFR level).",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "4c6b0c708d4258b9",
